}%
We now do one ordinary task in two ways: we find out which files a
directory holds.  A \emph{directory} is what graphical systems call a
folder, a named place where files are kept.  Ours is called
[[demo]]; \cref{fig:demo-gui} shows it in a file manager.
\end{onlyin}
