\begin{onlyin}{english} % sync english=21574f swedish=1a1494
\leavevmode\ltnote{%
  Relevant learning objective: \cref{InterfacesLOBoth}.

  A predict-the-output exercise, used here because it tests a
  misconception: that a command's output is fixed, whoever reads it.
  A student who holds it predicts \texttt{1}, since [[ls]] printed one
  line in \cref{ex:ls}.  The premise the prediction needs (one line on
