}%
We return to the command line with a new tool.  The program [[wc]],
short for \emph{word count}, counts what it reads; with the
\emph{option} [[-l]] it counts lines.  The bar [[|]], a \emph{pipe},
sends what one command writes to another command instead of to the
screen.
\end{onlyin}
\begin{onlyin}{swedish}
\leavevmode\ltnote{%
  Relevant lärandemål: \cref{InterfacesLOBoth}.

